# PaintOmics local secrets.
#
# Copy to `.env` beside this file and fill in. `.env` is gitignored; this
# example is tracked, so it is the file that tells the next person what to set.
#
#     cp PaintomicsServer/.env.example PaintomicsServer/.env
#
# serverconf.py loads it at import, so it works for every launch path -- the
# CLI, the WSGI app, and a test runner -- without remembering to export
# anything. A REAL environment variable always wins over this file, so a
# deployment that configures the environment through systemd or the container
# is never overridden by a stray .env.

# CSIC LLM gateway. Self-service tokens: https://console.llm.iiia.es
# Without it the gateway answers 401 "Malformed API Key ... Ensure Key has
# `Bearer ` prefix", which means NO TOKEN -- not a header bug.
AI_CSIC_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults are in serverconf.py.
# AI_LLM_PROVIDER=csic
# AI_CSIC_MODEL=deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731

# Optional: pace the gateway, in requests/minute, for every caller in the
# process together. Unset: read from the key's own x-litellm-key-rpm-limit
# header and paced at 90% of it (54 for the CSIC key's 60); no header, no
# pacing. 0 turns pacing off. Without it, concurrent Writers and paper agents
# exhaust the key and are dropped.
# AI_LLM_MAX_RPM=55

# Optional. NCBI allows 10 req/s with a key, 3 without.
# AI_PUBMED_API_KEY=
